sort — Sort lines

Sorts the contents of a file alphabetically by default.

sort file.txt

Example names.txt:

Sunil
Ravi
Amit
Kiran
sort names.txt

Output:

Amit
Kiran
Ravi
Sunil
Common options

Reverse order

sort -r names.txt

Numeric sorting

sort -n numbers.txt

Example:

100
20
5
50
sort -n numbers.txt

Output:

5
20
50
100

Sort and remove duplicates

sort -u file.txt


