1. more

more displays a file one screen at a time.

more application.log

If the file is large, you can navigate through it.

Important keys
Key	      Action
Space    	Next page
Enter     	Next line
b	        Previous page
q	           Quit
/word    	Search for word

Example:

more /var/log/application.log
2. less
...........................
less also displays a file page by page.

less application.log

less is generally more convenient for large log files because it supports navigation in both directions and searching.

Important     keys
Key	       Action
Space	       Next page
b	        Previous page
↑ / ↓      	Move line by line
g	          Go to beginning
G          	Go to end
/ERROR	 Search forward
?ERROR	  Search backward
n	        Next search result
N	       Previous search result
q	           Quit



